1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,707
You gave it one message.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,856
Chusky turns it into work.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,989
It researches the right people, checks the fit, and builds the list.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,885
Saves it to your connected tools. Then prepares outreach for each person.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,117
With your approval, it reaches out—and schedules what comes next.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,440
It can make and answer calls, join meetings, and carry the conversation forward.

7
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,435
Then turn what was agreed into work across your tools.

8
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,739
It can return tomorrow, follow up, and keep checking in after someone becomes a customer.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,371
With budgets, approvals, and a record of what happened.

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,731
Chusky. Give it the goal. Keep your authority.

